  "result": "Perfect! \u2705 All 334 tests pass (17 new late fee tests + 20 VAT summary tests + 24 overdue tests + 273 existing).\n\n**`src/reports.js` updated with late fee calculation:**\n- `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` \u2014 Calculates daily late charges on overdue invoices\n\n**Function behavior:**\n- Returns 0 for draft invoices (no late fees)\n- Returns 0 for paid invoices (balance due is zero)\n- Charges only on issued and partially_paid invoices\n- Returns 0 if invoice is not yet due (dueDate >= asOf)\n- Charges 0.04% per day on the amount still due\n- Formula: `roundCents(balanceDue \u00d7 0.0004 \u00d7 daysOverdue)`\n\n**Key features:**\n- Respects all payment terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Charges only on remaining balance after partial payments\n- Uses banker's rounding for cent precision\n- Does not mutate invoice data\n\n**Test coverage (17 new tests):**\n- Not yet due returns 0\n- On due date returns 0\n- Overdue charges accumulate daily\n- Draft/paid invoices return 0\n- Partially paid invoices charge on remaining balance\n- Single and multi-day overdue periods\n- Different term types (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n- Deterministic calculations\n- Immutability verification\n- Integer result validation\n\nAll features implemented: overdueInvoices, vatSummary, and lateFee. Ready to ship.",
